B.SP=new A.bL(B.f2,["My money was deducted but the order isn't confirmed. What do I do?","If an amount was deducted but you didn't receive an order confirmation, the payment didn't complete verification \u2014 so no order was created and you are not charged. Any such amount is automatically refunded by your bank / UPI app, usually within 5\u20137 working days. If it doesn't reflect back, contact us with your payment reference (UTR / transaction ID)."],t.l)
B.SM=new A.bL(B.f2,["Can I cancel or get a refund after my order is confirmed?",'No. Once the restaurant confirms your order, preparation begins right away \u2014 so a confirmed order cannot be cancelled or refunded. You can cancel only while the order is still in the "Pending" stage (before it is confirmed).'],t.l)
